      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AIRFLOW BETTY (1) comes off a (19.36) win last time, scoring by 1.3 lengths in a Grade 5 over 340m at this track. Expected to go close. ISABELLA KADE (3) had been in super honest form hitting the frame two times on end before finishing fifth (18.60) at Richmond last time. Shapes as one to consider. TOMMY'S HITMAN (7) turned in a plain run last time when seventh at The Gardens over 400m behind Dashing Mimco (24.26) in a Free For All. Was in the money prior to that. Has performed well from this box with a win and five minor placings to his name from 11 starts. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. LORD EDDIE (4) cannot be left out after placing last start.",
